    "end_age": 16,
    "notes": "Every child between 7 and 16 must attend school (AS 14.30.010). A child who is 6 and already enrolled in first grade is also subject to compulsory attendance. Parents may opt out of enrollment at age 6 by notifying the school board in writing. No mandatory kindergarten. No September 1 cutoff specified in the statute for the age 7 threshold.",
